  "status": "hand",
  "note": "bundui.io — component + motion + blocks registry. 68 of 217 items already hold their page url (pattern: /components/<name>, /motion/animations|backgrounds|components|text-effects/<name>, /blocks/<section>/<name>). The other 149 are the demo files of a base component (accordion-default, accordion-collapsible, alert-with-icon, stat-cards-01, ripple-effect-02, …): they have no page of their own, each is shown on its base component's page (checked: /components/accordion carries accordion-default/-collapsible/-with-plus-icon), so a rewrite maps '<base>-<demo>' to the base page path and one template fills it. All 149 url-less items match a page name from the site's 112-url sitemap (longest base name first, 41 target pages). robots.txt allows /. A made-up path 404s (title '404: This page could not be found.'), no soft-404."
